spec.md

# --- internal docs & reports -------------------------------------------------
# Repo root IS the deploy root here (outputDirectory ".", cleanUrls true), so
# every tracked file is a live URL. On 2026-07-25 an audit found 18 internal
# files served 200 and crawlable on this domain, including CLAUDE.md,
# OWNER_ACTIONS_GITDEALFLOW.md and the HERMES conversion reports — i.e. the
# unpublished go-to-market plan for the one site in the portfolio with paying
# customers. Globs, not exact names, so the families this repo keeps generating
# are caught as they appear.
CLAUDE.md
HERMES_*.md
REPORT_*.md
OWNER_*.md
*AUDIT*.md
*SCORECARD*.md

# --- internal tooling: pSEO / i18n generators and ops scripts ---------------
# These were served publicly too. No credentials were found in them — the
# IndexNow key in scripts/indexnow-ping.sh is public by design, served at
# /<key>.txt as the verification mechanism — so this was information disclosure
# rather than credential exposure.
_*.py
_*.mjs
scripts/
data/momentum-index/_build_momentum_index.mjs

# DO NOT add these — they are served on purpose:
#   agents.md, llms.txt, llms-full.txt, ai.txt      -> AI/AEO discovery surfaces
#   <hex>.txt                                       -> IndexNow key verification
#   google*.html, BingSiteAuth.xml                  -> search-engine verification
#   mcp-demo.gif                                    -> see CLAUDE.md, do not remove
#   data/startup-ma-statistics/data.csv             -> CC BY datasets, each cited
#   research/vc-deal-flow-signal-2026/data.csv         from its own landing page
